2026-07-27T07:51:43.9324999Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9325648Z i /tmp/Rtmp9QFKQx/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9325985Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9326381Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9327081Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9327634Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9328435Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9329336Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9562050Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:51:43.9668906Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:51:44.0089442Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:51:44.0252195Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
